  articleID: www.newmanila.gov.ph/services/dogshelter/events
  title: 'Puppy Play Date '
  bodyText: "Need a shot of happiness? The New Manila City Dog Shelter is opening
    its doors for an all-day Puppy Play Date this October 25th! Local residents can
    drop in to play with rescue pups and even adopt if you find your match!\r\n\r\nMunicipal
    Event Briefing: Citywide All-Day Puppy Play Date & Adoption Fair\r\n\r\nThe New
    Manila City Dog Shelter invites local residents to participate in our quarterly
    All-Day Puppy Play Date. This municipal initiative promotes early canine behavioral
    socialization, public education on humane pet ownership, and rehoming opportunities
    for eligible rescue puppies.\r\n\r\nKey Event Details\r\nInformation Field :
    Official Event Details\r\nDate & Time : Saturday, October 24, 2026 | 9:00 AM
    \u2013 4:30 PM\r\nLocation : New Manila City Dog Shelter\r\nAdmission Fee : Free
    (Mandatory online pre-registration required)\r\n"
  headliner: <b>The City Dog Shelter is hosting an all-day Puppy Play Date!</b>
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
